Usage: <program> [options]

Options:
  -v, --verbose            print extra detail
  -q, --quiet              suppress normal output
  --color MODE             control terminal color [choices: auto, always, never]
  --config CONFIG          configuration file [default: default] [env: COMMANDS_CONFIG]
  serve                    Start the service and listen for requests
  import                   Import one data file
  plan                     preview changes
  --help                   show this help
  --version                show version
